cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "引用本软件时请使用以下信息 / If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "liteOS: a stateless motion-control base"
abstract: >-
  liteOS is not an operating system but a base: a stateless foundation that does
  exactly one thing, motion control, and can be ridden by any hot-pluggable upper
  brain. Everything is treated as a motion object; the base is the only
  non-object. It runs on x86_64 and riscv64 and is verified under QEMU on both.
type: software
license: MIT

authors:
  - name: "liteOS contributors"

# 版本号遵循语义化版本；本项目尚未发布归档版本（CHANGELOG 只有 Unreleased），
# 因此不声明 version 与 date-released，避免生成虚假的发布日期。
# Versioning follows Semantic Versioning; the project has not released an archive
# (CHANGELOG has only "Unreleased"), so version and date-released are omitted to
# avoid fabricating a release date.

repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/REPO"
